      "continueLabel": "继续",
      "autoContinue": false,
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "E1",
          "label": "先闻马蹄",
          "rect": [
            0.007812,
            0.003906,
            0.984375,
            0.186849
          ],
          "duration": 2.8,
          "transition": {
            "type": "smooth",
            "durationMs": 260
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "旁白",
              "text": "同源电脉冲开封脉死锁，门后压抑的马蹄与鼻息一清二楚。",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "pan",
                "intensity": 0.14,
                "anchor": [
                  0.38,
                  0.48
                ],
                "panTo": [
                  0.54,
                  0.46
                ],
                "easing": "smoothstep"
              }
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Lee",
              "text": "还以为你那三脚猫的雷法锁住了我，躲在门后打闷棍？黑龙，你算错了。",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "push",
                "intensity": 0.18,
                "anchor": [
                  0.46,
                  0.44
                ],
                "easing": "ease-out"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "E2",
          "label": "错步避剑",
          "rect": [
            0.007812,
            0.197917,
            0.984375,
            0.213542
          ],
          "duration": 2.6,
          "transition": {
            "type": "cut",
            "durationMs": 0
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "黑龙",
              "text": "逐出教门的邛池孽障，给我躺下！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "pan",
                "intensity": 0.16,
                "anchor": [
                  0.36,
                  0.48
                ],
                "panTo": [
                  0.64,
                  0.5
                ],
                "shake": 0.12,
                "easing": "ease-out"
              }
            },
            {
              "speaker": "旁白",
              "text": "重剑擦肩劈空，Lee 伏身错步，瞬间抢入黑龙身侧。",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "push",
                "intensity": 0.18,
                "anchor": [
                  0.68,
                  0.48
                ],
                "easing": "ease-out"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "E3",
          "label": "飞身侧踹",
          "rect": [
            0.007812,
            0.417969,
            0.984375,
            0.305339
          ],
          "duration": 3.0,
          "transition": {
            "type": "cut",
            "durationMs": 0
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "Lee",
              "text": "喝啊——！这一脚，谢你替我冲开经脉！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "shake",
                "intensity": 0.28,
                "anchor": [
                  0.52,
                  0.48
                ],
                "shake": 0.25
              }
            },
            {
              "speaker": "旁白",
              "text": "一记飞身侧踹正中胸甲，将黑龙连人带甲硬生生震退！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "pull",
                "intensity": 0.14,
                "anchor": [
                  0.46,
                  0.48
                ],
                "easing": "smoothstep"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "E4",
          "label": "内堂对峙",
          "rect": [
            0.007812,
            0.730469,
            0.984375,
            0.265625
          ],
          "duration": 3.2,
          "transition": {
            "type": "smooth",
            "durationMs": 320
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "黑龙",
              "text": "不可能……我照着长兄的规矩放雷，怎么反倒替你冲开了封脉死锁？！内堂弟子听令，随我碾碎他！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "pan",
                "intensity": 0.14,
                "anchor": [
                  0.66,
                  0.48
                ],
                "panTo": [
                  0.38,
                  0.5
                ],
                "easing": "smoothstep"
              }
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Lee",
              "text": "照葫芦画瓢的蠢货。来吧，内堂见真章！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "push",
                "intensity": 0.16,
                "anchor": [
                  0.32,
                  0.5
                ],
                "easing": "ease-out"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lee-breakout",
      "title": "Lee · 攻入黑龙堂",
      "note": "死亡游戏 · 崩链破壁",
