          "duration": 2.6,
          "transition": {
            "type": "smooth",
            "durationMs": 240
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "Lee",
              "text": "最后那几道电脉总算把当年的封脉死锁震碎了，只是呼吸还没缓过来……",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "push",
                "intensity": 0.15,
                "anchor": [
                  0.44,
                  0.48
                ],
                "easing": "smoothstep"
              }
            },
            {
              "speaker": "旁白",
              "text": "死脉初通、电劲未稳，门后的铁骑已趁隙冲至身后。",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "pan",
                "intensity": 0.12,
                "anchor": [
                  0.46,
                  0.5
                ],
                "panTo": [
                  0.64,
                  0.48
                ],
                "easing": "ease-in"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "L2",
          "label": "乘隙冲撞",
          "rect": [
            0.007812,
            0.201823,
            0.984375,
            0.208333
          ],
          "duration": 2.4,
          "transition": {
            "type": "cut",
            "durationMs": 0
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "旁白",
              "text": "转身慢了半拍，沉重的铁骑已迎面撞来！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "shake",
                "intensity": 0.25,
                "anchor": [
                  0.52,
                  0.48
                ],
                "shake": 0.22
              }
            },
            {
              "speaker": "黑龙",
              "text": "闯过三轮护堂神雷还能站着？给我倒下！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "push",
                "intensity": 0.18,
                "anchor": [
                  0.4,
                  0.46
                ],
                "easing": "ease-out"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
