          "label": "铁箍锁腕",
          "rect": [
            0.007812,
            0.416667,
            0.984375,
            0.1875
          ],
          "duration": 2.8,
          "transition": {
            "type": "cut",
            "durationMs": 0
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "旁白",
              "text": "沉重的铁箍将双腕死死锁在内堂石壁上。",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "pan",
                "intensity": 0.14,
                "anchor": [
                  0.34,
                  0.48
                ],
                "panTo": [
                  0.62,
                  0.5
                ],
                "easing": "smoothstep"
              }
            },
            {
              "speaker": "黑龙",
              "text": "中兴留下的最后一把破剑，凭长兄传下的雷法与铁箍还治不了你？锁在壁上等长兄发落！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "push",
                "intensity": 0.14,
                "anchor": [
                  0.64,
                  0.48
                ],
                "easing": "ease-out"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "L4",
          "label": "屏息聚力",
          "rect": [
            0.007812,
            0.611328,
            0.984375,
            0.123047
          ],
          "duration": 2.6,
          "transition": {
            "type": "smooth",
            "durationMs": 260
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "旁白",
              "text": "Lee 屏住呼吸，借着铁箍的压迫，将嗡鸣激荡的电劲尽数收进双拳。",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "hold",
                "anchor": [
                  0.48,
                  0.48
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Lee",
              "text": "只懂照搬规矩的蠢货……这副铁箍，正好帮我把重归巅峰的最后一口气合上！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "push",
                "intensity": 0.18,
                "anchor": [
                  0.5,
                  0.46
                ],
                "easing": "ease-in"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "L5",
          "label": "崩链而出",
          "rect": [
            0.007812,
            0.740885,
            0.984375,
            0.255208
          ],
          "duration": 3.2,
          "transition": {
            "type": "cut",
            "durationMs": 0
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "旁白",
              "text": "双臂猛然发力下拽，石壁开裂，锁腕的铁链应声崩断！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "shake",
                "intensity": 0.3,
                "anchor": [
                  0.46,
                  0.46
                ],
                "shake": 0.26
              }
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Lee",
              "text": "阿打——！！把我们当器物铸、当废铁锁？睁眼看看，这把剑还没断！",
              "camera": {
                "motion": "pull",
                "intensity": 0.16,
                "anchor": [
                  0.5,
                  0.48
                ],
                "easing": "ease-out"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
